に計上する見込みです。配当につきましては、2026年２月５日に株主還元方針を変更し、連結配当性向の目安を30％以上とすること、但し、年間配当金の下限を1株当たり80円とすることを公表しており、この配当方針に基づくと、2026年３月期の年間配当は１株当たり80円を公表しておりましたが、上記のとおり、投資有価証券売却益を2026年３月期第４四半期において特別利益に計上することにより、2026年３月期の配当は、連結配当性向30％を目安とする業績連動型の配当となる見込みです。今後、配当予想の修正につきましては確定次第速やかに公表いたします。", null, "CurrentYearInstant"], ["売上高", "NetSales", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 5100000000, "5,100", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["営業利益", "OperatingIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 570000000, "570", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["経常利益", "OrdinaryIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 540000000, "540", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["ProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "ProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 310000000, "310", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["NetIncomePerShare", "NetIncomePerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 160.61, "160.61", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["売上高", "NetSales", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 5100000000, "5,100", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["営業利益", "OperatingIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 570000000, "570", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["経常利益", "OrdinaryIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 540000000, "540", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["ProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "ProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 660000000, "660", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["NetIncomePerShare", "NetIncomePerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 341.95, "341.95", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["AmountChangeProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "AmountChangeProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 350000000, 